Douyin Downloader is a '''cross-platform''' download tool for '''Douyin''' videos, built with '''Tauri'''. It provides a simple and easy-to-use interface for downloading videos from the popular Chinese social media platform. The tool is available for '''Windows''', '''macOS''', and '''Linux''' operating systems.

== Overview ==
The Douyin Downloader tool is designed to be user-friendly and efficient. It utilizes the '''Tauri''' framework, which allows for '''cross-platform''' compatibility and a native desktop experience. The tool's interface is straightforward, making it easy for users to navigate and download their desired videos.

=== Features ===
The Douyin Downloader tool offers several key features, including:
* '''Cross-platform''' support for '''Windows''', '''macOS''', and '''Linux'''
* A simple and intuitive interface for downloading '''Douyin''' videos
* Support for various video formats and resolutions

== Installation ==
To install the Douyin Downloader tool, users can download the latest release from the [GitHub repository](https://github.com/lzdyes/douyin-downloader/releases). The tool is available for '''Windows x64''', '''Linux x86_64''', and '''macOS 10.13+'''. Alternatively, users can build the tool themselves from the source code, which supports '''Windows''', '''Linux''', and '''macOS 10.13+'''. Note that '''Windows''' users may need to install '''Webview2''' to run the application.

